+  // Stall attribution (DXVK_STALL_LOG=<path>).
+  //
+  // The 4K frame is 40 ms with the GPU doing ~3 ms of work and neither of the two busy threads
+  // saturated -- the profile of two threads waiting on each other rather than of either being
+  // the cost. This measures the waiting directly: how long the calling thread spends blocked
+  // inside the places where D3D9 can block, per frame. Reported in milliseconds per frame, so
+  // a bucket at 20 in a 40 ms frame is half the frame spent doing nothing.
+  //
